message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite the software and its accompanying
  report using the metadata below.
title: "Spin-Resolved VQE-QSE Simulation of Ethylene"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "AbouShmeila"
    given-names: "Abdelrahman A."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-2320-6042"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-08
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A validated VQE and quantum subspace expansion workflow for the ground and
  excited states of planar and 90-degree-twisted ethylene. The repository
  includes active-space Hamiltonian construction, CASCI validation, ideal and
  noise-aware simulation, error mitigation, IBM Quantum hardware execution,
  classical benchmarking, and a butadiene extension.
keywords:
  - variational quantum eigensolver
  - quantum subspace expansion
  - quantum chemistry
  - ethylene
  - excited states
  - error mitigation
  - Qiskit
  - IBM Quantum
